      "writtenOn": "2023-04-21T16:11:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Based on the fan curve that Kornel provided, would updating these help `board_override_fan_control_duty()` behave more correctly?\n\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Rm7xnWqJLeKZvHpNDt-LF1gt0vlRwWKQitpu0HdVS-M/edit?resourcekey\u003d0-U7xMtFOlsvTgdzzH3PI1oA#gid\u003d0\n\n```\n\trpm_min \u003d \u003c2300\u003e;\n\trpm_start \u003d \u003c2800\u003e;\n\trpm_max \u003d \u003c5600\u003e;\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 197,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 199,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "fe7fe93ca71038023e432e8aef51d52e11464624",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2983b28e_a5ce3f57",
        "filename": "zephyr/program/skyrim/winterhold/project.overlay",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 199,
      "author": {
        "id": 1565377
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-21T16:33:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Those values were selected by the and I believe that they\u0027re correct.\nThe resoning behind the numbers is the following:\n\n1. rpm_max was set to 4800 to meet the max noise requirements. This was confirmed  by the ODM during a meeting I had with them.\n2. rpm_start is set to 2800 to make sure that the static friction is overcome and the fan starts spinning. We could go slight lower here, but we want to have a margin of safety.\n3. rpm_min is set to 2100, this is enough to keep the fan spinning, and provide just a little bit of cooling. We want to have it low to prevent the fan stop -\u003e fan start scenerio from happening too frequently.",
      "parentUuid": "f5d3869e_5207f98f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 197,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 199,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "fe7fe93ca71038023e432e8aef51d52e11464624",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e827bfcd_67f1a790",
        "filename": "zephyr/program/skyrim/winterhold/project.overlay",
        "patchSetId": 11
