        "id": 1565377
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-21T16:37:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To expand on that.\nWhen the fan is started the RPM is set to rpm_start(2800) first.\nThen depending on how much cooling is needed it might be decreased down to rpm_min(2100).",
      "parentUuid": "2983b28e_a5ce3f57",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 197,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 199,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "fe7fe93ca71038023e432e8aef51d52e11464624",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
